  "description": "Fuaran.MVU.Session: an optional session log for the Fuaran.MVU runtime. Each decided step is recorded as an op of a Fuaran.Core op-stream, under a disclosure function the host passes (a withheld value is a keyed commitment, a secret is never written); a replay performs nothing and replays the recorded decisions; a restore resumes the runtime, sending idempotent effects again and answering the rest as interrupted. Depends on Fuaran.MVU, FSharp.Core and the published Fuaran.Core.OpStream package.",
